<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="FF8040"><br>皆様のおかげを持ちましてVIVA！　KING成敗と相成りました。<br>次がLASTだiyahoho ho-i :)<br><br>では賞品一覧を　前回のもココに乗せてます<br><br>【1】Stained Cloth Mask　　<br>MAGICITEM LOREITEM Slot:FACE<br>Charge10<br>AC:6 CHA: +4 HP:+20 MANA:+20<br>SVD:+5 SVP:+5<br>Effect:Ultravision<br>WT:3.0 SMALL<br>Class:ALL Race:ALL<br><br>【2】Argent Defender<br>MAGICITEM Slot:PRIMARY<br>2HS Atk Delay:49 DMG 33 <br>MANA:+20<br>WT:10.0 LARGE<br>Class:WAR PAL RNG SHD Race:ALL<br><br>【3】Intricate Silver Rapier<br>MAGICITEM Slot:PRIMARY SECONDARY<br>Piercing Atk Delay:27 DMG 13 <br>AC:5 CHA: +15<br>WT:1.5 SMALL<br>Class:WAR RNG BRD ROG Race:ALL<br><br>【4】Argent Protector<br>Slot:PRIMARY  <br>Skill:2HS  AtkDelay:49<br>DMG:42 AC:10<br>STR:+10 WIS:+10 INT:+10 HP:+25 MANA:+25<br>WT:10.0 Size:LARGE<br>Class:WAR PAL RNG SHD<br>Race:ALL<br><br>【5】Jagged Chokidai Spine<br>MAGICITEM LOREITEM<br>Slot:PRIMARY SECONDARY<br>Skill:Piercing  AtkDelay:25<br>DMG:9<br>DEX:+4<br>WT:1.0 Size:MEDIUM<br>Class:WAR RNG SHD BRD ROG BST<br>Race:ALL<br><br>【6】Sarnak Arcane Fetish<br>LOREITEM<br>Slot:NECK<br>DEX:+2 CHA:+5 INT:+6<br>Focus Effect:Enhancement HasteII<br>WT:0.1 Size:TINY<br>Class:ALL Race:ALL<br><br>【7】 spell:Acumen 　　　　　　　　SHM56 BST65<br>【8】 spell:Thrall of Bones　　　　NEC54<br>【9】 spell:Dementia 　　　　　　　ENC54<br>【10】spell:Spirit of the storm　 BST53<br>【11】spell:Conjure Corpse        SHD(65) NEC(57)<br>【12】spell:Augment               ENC(56)<br>【13】spell:Yaulp IV              CLR(53) PAL(60) <br><br>*****　LOYSPELLの元～♪　*****<br><br>【14】 words of Constancy<br>・Conjure Corpse (Necromancer 57)<br>・Infusion (Necromancer 55)<br>・Improved Invisibility to Undead (Cleric 50)<br>・Gangrenous Touch of Zum'uul (Necromancer 60)<br>【15】words of Holding<br>・Devouring Darkness (Necromancer 59)<br>・Bonds of Tunare (Druid 57)<br>【16】words of Asylum<br>・Dead Man Floating (Necromancer 44)<br>・Quivering Veil of Xarn (Necromancer 58)<br>・Shadowbond (Necromancer 54)<br>・Death Pact (Cleric 51)<br>【17】Toharon's Memoir Pg 22<br>・Wind of Tishanian (Enchanter 60)<br>・Divine Intervention (Cleric 60)<br>・Naltrons Mark (Cleric 58)<br>・Aegolism (Cleric 60)<br>・Protection of the Glades (Druid 60)<br>【18】Words of Annisilation<br>・Sacrifice (Necromancer 51)<br>・Malosini (Shaman 57)<br>・Judgement (Cleric 56)<br>【19】Words of Energy<br>・Thrall of Bones (Necromancer 54)<br>・Quivering Veil of Xarn (Necromancer 58)<br>・Malo (Shaman 60)<br>・Focus of the Spirit (Shaman 60)<br>【20】Words of Misery<br>・Devouring Darkness (Necromancer 59)<br>・Conjure Corpse (Necromancer 57)<br>・Trucidation (Necromancer 60)<br>・Bane of Nife (Shaman 56)<br>・Judgement (Cleric 56)<br>・Funeral Pyre of Kelador (Necromancer 60)<br>【21】Part of Zeannor's Thesis Pg.15<br>・Dementing Visions (Enchanter 58)<br>【22】Flame of Fennin<br>・Greater Voceration: Fire (Magician 58)<br>・Aegis of Ro (Magician 60)<br>・Rage of Zomm (Magician 55)<br>・Fortitude (Cleric 55)<br>・Burnout IV (Magician 55)<br>・Shock of Fiery Blades (Magician 60)<br><br>【23】Blue Diamond<br>【24】前回余りのお金　538PP<br>【25】今回の売上　　　1525PP<br><br>前回のLOTTINがagPだけって…しくしく<br>なので前回ITEMを今回参加者の方へも参加して頂きたく再掲載してます　奮ってご参加の程を～<br>と、参加の方のLVLが結構高かったのでもうITEMはいらないのだろう！！　　と判断し複数LOTT　OKと致します（但し1stUSERのみ）<br><br>と第2回参加者の方は強制【24】LOTTIN、第3回参加の方も強制【25】LOTTIN　とします(゜▽゜*)　oremo furukara-<br><br>1st needer は 【100-200】　その他は　【0-100】でよろ<br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#000000>HanaC：99</font><br>
 <font color=#000000>Majinger：85</font><br>
 <font color=#000000>JyunP：78</font><br>
